  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to third party monitoring of the cotton harvest regarding child and forced labour in Uzbekistan - Administrative Agreement with the World Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Project will be conducted in the framework of a World Bank (WB) Support Programme (SP) aimed at contributing to the labour reform of the cotton sector. This SP will include (1) capacity building of state and non-state institutions to address labour issues, (2) third-party monitoring of child and forced labour, (3) feedback mechanism. The Project will cover the financing of components 2 and 3, which will be implemented by the International Labour Organization (ILO).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
